WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"Billy on the Street,"
had never, until this year --

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:02.902 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And congratulations.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so happy.
It's so well-deserved.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys got nominated
for an Emmy.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For best variety
sketch series, yes.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:10.643 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:14.247
-Yes. And you used Donald Trump
in your Emmy campaign.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We did. This was
a huge billboard in L.A.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.518
It said, "You nominated
Donald Trump for an Emmy,

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.887 size:81% position:41%
but you won't nominate
'Billy on the Street'?

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
Be on the right side
of history."

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
-Yes.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.826 size:78% position:39%
And we got nominated!
-You got nominated.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But hold on.
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:31.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
I need to say something
about this.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I'm very happy
to be nominated.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.701
It's very nice.
-It's an honor to be nominated.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.468 line:92%
-An honor to be nominated.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:39.906
But since -- I swear, since
the second I got nominated,

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:40.640 line:92%
everyone is saying to me,

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.477
"Well, you know you're gonna
lose to 'Saturday Night Live.'"

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:45.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right?
-Yeah.

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because they're in
the same category.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right now, on the one hand,
I'm honest about these things.

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.485 line:92%
I know all about award shows.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.988 line:92%
It's probably true, you know?

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.856 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"SNL" is great.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:57.957 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I grew up with "SNL."

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.626 line:92%
You know, I watched it as a kid.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.428 size:75% position:38% line:92%
On the other hand...

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:04.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
what is another award gonna do
for "Saturday Night Live"?

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:05.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah, that's true.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.667
-I mean,
let's talk about this honestly.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Great.
Let's get it out there.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.305
-Okay. Now, I know I'm supposed
to just be nice and gracious

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.909
and happy to be nominated,
but that is simply not the case.

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Okay?

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And not the Billy I know.
-No.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.714
It wouldn't be true to myself
if I didn't say these things.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:22.148 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why does Lorne Michaels
need another award?

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:26.820 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Listen to --

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know he produces
this show, too.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But he's -- he's -- he's --

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.091 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:33.159
Oh, we're just getting started,
by the way.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:33.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, he's a TV legend, right?
-Yes.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He has millions of dollars.
-Yes.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Countless awards.
-Tons.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And a lifelong friendship
with Paul Simon.

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you know --
-And Paul McCartney.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And Paul McCartney.
That's right.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I have?
-What?

00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:48.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Student loans.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:52.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
I still -- I do!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Still?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.350 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I have student loans!

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.185 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I'm not on fancy NBC.

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.820 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I was on truTV!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:01.621 line:92%
I don't even need the award.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.958
I need to melt down the gold
and take it to a pawn shop.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:05.658 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.393 line:92%
I have health insurance, Seth.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.996
And "Saturday Night Live" --
why does "Saturday Night Li--"

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I get it.
It's an institution.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:12.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a staple.
-Yeah.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:17.670
-Okay. But that's like giving an
Emmy award to pizza, you know?

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.138 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:22.475
-That's like saying, "And the
Emmy goes to a piece of pizza."

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.009 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:25.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like,
we all know pizza's great.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:25.745 line:92%
It's been around forever.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't think
it needs to be congratulated.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Seth.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then people say --
Then people say,

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:34.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, 'Saturday Night Live,'
it had a great year."

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.755 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Well, it's about time!

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.590 line:92%
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:41.561 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I mean, they've had --

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.963 line:92%
They've had 45 years to prepare!

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:44.497 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:48.835
I guess sometimes it takes four
decades to "work out the kinks"!

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:50.336 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.038 line:92%
And then -- then people say,

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, 'SNL,'
it has Kate McKinnon."

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:57.243
Well, can you imagine how much
harder it is not to have her?

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:57.911 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, that's true.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:00.847 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm at a severe disadvantage.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:03.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's not only "SNL"
in the category.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:06.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tracey Ullman, another legend
is in the category.

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, probably
has won that before.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.557 line:92%
-Many times in the '90s, right?

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:12.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
She basically established
that category.

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:15.094 size:78% position:39%
But I am here tonight
to officially begin

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:18.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
my smear campaign
against Tracey Ullman.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:19.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good.
This is healthy.

00:03:19.332 --> 00:03:20.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
People don't know this.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:23.469 line:92%
Tracey Ullman was in ISIS.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No!
-Yes.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
That's right!

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:28.575 line:92%
Tracey Ullman is a terrorist!

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As herself
or one of her characters?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know!
She was wearing that hood.

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:35.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
Who knows what voices
she was doing under there.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:38.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was her and Marty Short,
Catherine O'Hara.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:39.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:42.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
-ISIS started out
as a sketch-comedy group.

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:42.822 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, gotcha.

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:45.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-People don't know that.
It's very hush-hush.

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right?
But it's true.

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:49.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I want you
to join with me now

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:51.364 line:92%
in a chant about Tracey Ullman.

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.265 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Are you ready?

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:54.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
Lock her up!
-Oh, no!

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:57.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Lock her up!
Lock her up!

00:03:57.604 --> 00:03:58.571 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Lock her up!

00:03:58.571 --> 00:03:59.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
Thank you.

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
"Billy on the Street."

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
This was an incredible moment
of campaigning.

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let me say one more thing,
Seth.

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:08.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you know when
"Saturday Night Live" started,

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:11.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
women did not have the right
to vote in this country?

00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:12.986 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's true.
-It's true!

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:15.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why are we gonna
give an award to that?

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:16.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:18.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow, this is --
This is quite convincing.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:19.325 line:92%
Now, I should note that --

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:22.996
-I'm realizing now, maybe
that isn't doing me any favors,

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:23.563 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
what I just said.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:26.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But again, I also
have a show in that category,

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.066 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Documentary Now!"

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:28.735
-Yeah, but that's not gonna win.
-Okay.

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:30.270 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, come on.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.505 line:92%
Billy Eichner, everybody!

